# ==============================================================================
# Docs Project Target Languages
# ==============================================================================
#
# Copy to docs-languages.conf in the docs project's own repository root
# (not this tool's repository). Required whenever the docs project has
# any content/<lang>/ directory other than content/en/ — crowdin-init.sh
# refuses to guess a Crowdin language ID for a directory it can't map.
#
# Format:
#
#   docs_directory|Crowdin_language_ID|Display_name
#
# docs_directory is the project's own content/<docs_directory>/ name.
# Crowdin_language_ID must be a real Crowdin language (base or custom —
# see docs-custom-languages.conf.example). This is a mapping, not a
# fixed universal list: unlike phpbb-crowdin, only the languages a docs
# project already has content for are listed, since (unlike phpBB's
# language packs) a docs project adds languages deliberately, one real
# translation at a time.
# ==============================================================================

da|da|Danish
fr|fr|French
de|de|German (Formal Honorifics)
